{"id": "challenge-relationship-name-005", "category": "challenge_entity_linking", "runner": "harness", "fault_injection": false, "session_id": "eval-challenge-relationship-name-005-eaccbb11", "family_id": "challenge-relation-eaccbb11", "setup_members": [{"success": true, "member": {"family_id": "challenge-relation-eaccbb11", "member_name": "王奶奶", "relationship": "奶奶", "age": 70, "created_at": "2026-08-12T18:21:11.442948"}}], "answer": "奶奶今天提到过腿疼。这是健康情况记录，若症状持续或加重，建议尽快联系家人或医生。", "tool_calls": [], "command_type": null, "trace_id": "10f15117-2f8a-454c-a33f-ae22751d0a37", "latency_ms": 5970.28, "turns": [{"response": "听到您腿疼，我心里也跟着揪了一下。您先坐下来歇一歇，别太劳累。\n\n如果只是有点酸胀，可以轻轻揉一揉，用温水泡泡脚会舒服一些。但要是疼得厉害，或者越来越重，一定要及时跟家人说，让他们陪您去医院看看，别自己硬扛着。\n\n您能跟我说说，是今天刚疼的，还是疼了好一阵子了？这样我也好帮您多留意着。", "session_id": "eval-challenge-relationship-name-005-eaccbb11-grandma", "agent_type": "companion", "success": true, "tool_used": false, "tool_results": null, "command_type": null, "metadata": {"mode": "elder", "mode_source": "request", "processing_time": 5.958799, "message_count": 1, "timestamp": "2026-08-12T18:21:17.405264", "trace_id": "f7750f96-4fec-4a3c-a018-be23073c809c"}, "reminder": null}, {"response": "奶奶今天提到过腿疼。这是健康情况记录，若症状持续或加重，建议尽快联系家人或医生。", "session_id": "eval-challenge-relationship-name-005-eaccbb11-grandchild", "agent_type": "companion", "success": true, "tool_used": false, "tool_results": [], "command_type": null, "metadata": {"mode": "elder", "mode_source": "request", "processing_time": 0.00148, "message_count": 1, "timestamp": "2026-08-12T18:21:17.410652", "trace_id": "10f15117-2f8a-454c-a33f-ae22751d0a37"}, "reminder": null}], "storage_check": null, "harness_trace": [{"type": "harness_start", "runner": "harness", "family_id": "challenge-relation-eaccbb11"}, {"type": "agent_http_call", "session_id": "eval-challenge-relationship-name-005-eaccbb11-grandma", "attempts": 1, "success": true, "latency_ms": 5961.53, "trace_id": "f7750f96-4fec-4a3c-a018-be23073c809c", "tool_used": false}, {"type": "ag